  Vendored from Autoware. The <depend>s are upstream's that exist in this
  workspace; not here: autoware_internal_planning_msgs,
  autoware_utils_system, autoware_utils_visualization, libboost-dev,
  rclcpp, tf2, tf2_geometry_msgs, visualization_msgs;
